== Primary Tetrad ==
The four basic and fundamental sigils of casting magic are known as the Primary Tetrad.<ref name="PT">''Witch Hat Atelier'' Manga: [[Chapter 5]], Page 1</ref> This includes the Sigil of Fire, Water, Earth and Wind. A sigil can fall within the domain of the Primary Tetrad yet have a distinct enough effect to be considered a sigil of its own. In terms of design, these variants appear to be derived from the corresponding base sigil of the Primary Tetrad, as they are close enough that one may draw it by mistake{{Ref|[[Writing/Translated_Texts#Agott's_Primer_book]]}} or confuse one for the other.{{Ref|m|30|27}}

