==Time==
Time sigils are responsible for magic which manipulates time. There is currently one known time sigil.
===Repetition===
{{Magic Info
|magicimage=[[File:Repetition.png|left|100px]]
|magicname=くり返しの紋, ''Kurikaeshi no Mon''
|magicjp=紋, Crest • の, of • くり返し, Repetition
|magictl=Sigil of Repetition<ref name="Vol12" />{{Ref|m|28|12}}
|magicdesc=Official<ref name="Vol12" />{{Ref|m|28|12}}
}}
The '''Sigil of Repetition''' helps to prevent objects from changing by continuously resetting time for the objects it affects to the state they had when the spell first affected them. It is similar to a spring, restoring the object to its original state if that object is somehow changed. the “resetting” of the object also applies to its temperature, and not just its physical form. This can be used to make soft objects elastic, prevent things from rotting or to repair damaged objects. Repetition has been referred to a sign,{{Ref|m|7|17}} a seal,{{Ref|m|32|8}} and a sigil<ref name="Vol12"/>
[[File: Repetition Diagram.png|thumb|500px|left]]
{{-}}'''Spells Using Repetition'''</br>
[[Capture Pennant Spell]] • [[Coco's Village Wash Spring]] • [[Repetition Seal]] ([[Magic Cookpot]] • [[Serpent's Bed of Sand]] • [[Washbarrel Seal]]) • [[Spell of Reduction]]
{{-}}

